<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντονομ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>name instead, call by a new name,</i> c. dupl.acc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ -άζων ὅρος</span> plea <i>of
				avoidance and confession,</i> Arg.<i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>nominate instead,</i>
			
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1405.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντονομασίαι</span> or <i>rhetorical
				figures,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>use the pronoun,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				103.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					192.21
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, ib. <i><span class="en">
				98.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Arith., in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be of a contrary denomination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
